  "body": "The 0.14.0 cut wrote `RELEASE_NOTES.md` as its own section only, dropping every earlier release and the `---` separator. `release.yml`'s publish job takes this version's notes as everything before the first `---`, so the v0.14.0 run built all five platforms green but its publish job failed (\"RELEASE_NOTES.md has no '---' line\"). The tag was not moved; the v0.14.0 release was published by hand from that run's artifacts with the workflow's own template and contributor logic.\n\nThis puts the 0.14.0 section back on top of the full history from v0.13.0, separated by `---`, so the next cut prepends instead of replacing.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
